We tested both present → none. So all missing.\n\nHmm, hold on. Maybe the badge uses text color white on white because chip background missing? No, we'd see white.\n\nWait, maybe badges are only shown when \"Show full date\" is ON or \"Show date badges\"... Not.\n\nLet me double check on a task with a due time only maybe. But same.\n\nActually, let me reconsider: Is it possible that tasks.org doesn't display a due date badge when \"Show full task title\" is disabled? Hmm no.\n\nAlternatively, perhaps in this version badges were moved to the right side but require \"Chips\" start date toggle... The Start date toggle checked; but maybe the start date chip only displays when start date exists AND \"Show full date\" off? Eh.\n\nLet me sanity check with a simple test: complete a task? No.\n\nI'll keep that as a bug to report later (maybe after testing more to be certain and to gather exact info). Let me now restore Buy milk: remove start date; also revert Show full date setting to off. Actually, Show full date was off originally; I turned it on. Need to restore it before finishing. Let's remove start date now.\n\nOpen start date picker (element 3) and tap \"No date\". Note: start date shortcuts now include \"No date\". Let's do it."}
